# NOITE's hall (3fhall): the door this run's shuffle gives the shooting
# gallery starts the real TIRO, which wins: NOITE gets 0x40c (hides), then
# 0x40a won with +2100, shows itself, adds the score and goes to the
# prison.
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --headless --scene 3fhall --ms 40000 --input tools/play/tiro-3fhall-win.input
#
# The right click at 2000 is the WinExec; TIRO starts 1500 ms later (its
# WM_CREATE at 3500 seeds the targets). The shots are `tools/tiro_plan.py
# --start 3500 --win`. Same game with `--fix all`.
2000 rclick 80 200
3000 expect 3fhall
4000 dump tiro
